{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-02_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-02","title":"雨中漫步","storyCode":"4-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"4c51909419b23bc0c63c32f4597a094be1ca4fb42e7f2bcc9ee687d99e32e5d0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"還，還有兩個敵人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"他們正向東側的建築物逃竄——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經瞄準他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"正中靶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"噪音，會不會太大了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"這廢城區裡爆炸聲不斷，我想，敵人也不會特別在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你通知凱爾希醫生了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"在戰鬥開始前，我就已經通知過凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動在這片廢城中，確實有活動的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還在通話中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是不是更加隱蔽地行動會更好一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才的整合運動成員，似乎使用了探知型的法術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"為了不暴露我們的位置，必須先發制人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，不能讓整合運動之間互相聯絡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......終於解決了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉，去看看情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊器，拿一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，現在還不能懈怠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事情......我還是知道的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，好的，不會再說這些啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，聽得見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"一直在聽。確實不能懈怠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"潔西卡，你背後可能有敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎麼會......背後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......噫？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我能從背後攻擊你，說明你動作太慢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒事了，凱爾希醫生。我已經解決了敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你的速度確實好快......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至都沒看清楚你是怎麼摸過去，又那麼快趕回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——其實我還沒去偵查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"紅聯繫我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"龍門內部的潛藏著的整合運動還沒有活動的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"現階段還是不要打草驚蛇為妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"順便，綜合其它廢城偵察小隊的資訊，藏匿在廢城的整合運動的規模，可能遠比想像中要大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，中獎的反而是我們這邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"作為偵查小隊，還是有一些壓力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這麼說的話，到現在為止，我們所消滅的，已經是第二支整合運動小隊了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"你能確認我們第一次交火的敵人的身份嗎，潔西卡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，應該沒錯的。我有好好確認過，再讓你射擊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......怪我，光顧著計算彈道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"敵人的數量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"還不清楚具體數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"霜葉，你那邊如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"你們去吧，有問題隨時回饋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......過去她那裡看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們沒感受到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"溫度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一說......是有點冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"溫度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......的確，和城區外，至少有五度以上的溫差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"平白無故天氣就變了......怎麼會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"抬頭看。天氣沒有變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"不是天氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是這裡，來，摸一摸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......廢墟的牆體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。這堵牆，在吸收熱量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"吸溫過程，在我們來之前，可能就已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"牆體正在回溫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是什麼人，留下了這種痕跡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......在這個地方活動的，就只有整合運動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動？他們......怎麼做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽別人說過這麼一個傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——一個，關於雪怪的傳說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是......令人討厭的感覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["潔西卡"]}]}
